    image: "/poi-images/bobodioulasso-relief-v2.webp",
    description: { de: "Eine hügelige Landschaft im fruchtbaren Südwesten.", hu: "Dombság a termékeny délnyugaton.", ro: "Un peisaj deluros în sud-vestul fertil.", en: "The Bobo-Dioulasso relief is a mix of low plateaus and gentle hills around the city. It is less flat than the northern Sahel but still broadly open." , es: "Un paisaje de colinas en el fértil suroeste.", pt: "Uma paisagem de colinas no sudoeste fértil.", fr: "Un paysage vallonné dans le sud-ouest fertile."},
